    "payload_reason": "CARD-009 says 5 percent of lift unless MAINLINE-006 shows a better knee. On P2-E the knee is the 0 to 5 percent step, the steepest drop, not a different operating margin. Margins above 5 percent cost less safety factor per kilogram and are a worse trade. The point keeps 5 percent.",
